    "footer": null,
    "main_topic": [
      {
        "h_title": "For the ultimate paradise beach and snorkeling experience, the Instagram famous island of Koh NangYuan is just a five-minute longtail ride away from Koh Tao.",
        "main_title": "Spotlight Koh Tao 2025 at Sairee Beach",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Koh Nang Yaun is one of the most famous islands in all of Thailand, and many visitors will recognize it from postcards, travel magazines, and ‘best of’ holiday guides. Rated as one of the top 10 islands globally in the Trip Advisor Travelers Choice Awards, your stay Koh Tao would not be complete without visiting this iconic island.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "While described as a single island in its own right, Koh NangYuan is actually three separate landmasses connected by sand bars. It’s the perfect place to kick back and spend a day sunbathing, swimming, and snorkeling, and the spectacular viewpoint is not to be missed. Simply follow the wooden walkway around the southern-most island and head up the steps through the jungle. After 10 minutes, you’ll be rewarded with unbeatable views looking back down over the sand bars and the rest of the island. Take your selfie stick and prepare to get filtering, as this is one of the hottest Instagram spots in the world!",
            "url": "https://visitkohtao.org/detail-sub/3/22/47/viewpoints",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://visitkohtao.org/detail-sub/3/22/47/viewpoints",
                "anchor_text": "spectacular viewpoint"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "SOCIABLE ACCOMMODATION • ACTIVITIES AND EVENTS • SAFETY",
            "url": "https://visitkohtao.org/detail-sub/3/22/48/koh-nang-yuan/",
